   "text": "Day 30 rules\n15+ travelers, or 40+ bookings growing 25%+\n→ Tier 3 can be proposed for Tier 2\n40+ travelers on Tier 2 → proposed Tier 1\nAlways an override, at most one tier up",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "re47",
   "originalText": "Day 30 rules\n15+ travelers, or 40+ bookings growing 25%+\n→ Tier 3 can be proposed for Tier 2\n40+ travelers on Tier 2 → proposed Tier 1\nAlways an override, at most one tier up",
